# Relay desktop UI catalog, English (en), section: Messages panel.
# Project Fluent. English is the reference and the fallback: every id used in
# the code is defined in exactly one section file here, and a translation must
# use the same $variables. Ids are stable semantic keys, never the English text.
# See docs/i18n.md.

problem-messages-disabled = Messaging is turned off in the daemon.
problem-session-not-found = That call has no messaging session (any more).
problem-session-ended = The call has ended; the transcript is read-only.
problem-session-permission-off = That is turned off for this call (both sides must allow it).
problem-peer-unavailable = The other side cannot be reached right now.
problem-text-invalid = That text cannot be sent (control or invisible characters).
problem-text-too-long = That message is longer than 4096 bytes.
problem-image-invalid = That image cannot be sent.
problem-image-too-large = That image is too large to send inline; offer it as a file.
problem-history-full = The message history of this call is full. Export it and clear it.
problem-rate-limited = Slow down: too many messages.
problem-too-many-offers = Too many file offers in this call.
problem-message-not-found = That message cannot be changed now.
problem-offer-not-found = That file offer cannot be changed now.
problem-file-refused = The daemon refused that file (it must be a regular file, not a link).
problem-file-too-large = That file is over the daemon's offer size limit.
problem-file-changed = The file changed while it was being read; offer it again.
problem-too-many-transfers = Two transfers are already running; wait for one to finish.
problem-no-space = Not enough free space in that folder.
problem-destination-invalid = That folder or file name cannot be used.
problem-preview-unavailable = No text preview is possible for that file.
problem-export-too-large = The export is too large to return; choose a file.
problem-export-write-failed = The daemon could not write the export file.
problem-invalid-setting = The daemon refused that setting.
problem-default = The daemon refused the request.
delivery-timeout = Not delivered: the other side did not answer.
