problem-permission-denied = The daemon did not grant this app the messages capability.
msg-gate-policy = Transcripts are private to the people in the call, so only a client that asks for the capability can read them. Check the daemon's client policy; this app asks again every 30 seconds.
msg-gate-disconnected = Not connected to the daemon, so messages are unavailable.
msg-gate-daemon-off-note = No messages are sent or received. Existing transcripts stay readable.
msg-gate-daemon-enable = Turn on in the daemon
